      "text": "CORE-001 P1: .saipen/kitchen/t390-red-control.sh::run_control / release.ps1 temporary mutation isolation - the T-390 instrument control mutates the live release entrypoint in place for the duration of a full suite run, so any concurrent archive, audit, test, editor, release attempt, crash or interruption can capture or retain the mutant."
