      "text": "CORE-002 P2: tests/Run-Tests.ps1:1153-1204 T-390 release-gate derivation still infers execution from source-string conventions - $gateRefs is computed by scanning raw release.ps1 text, so a nested or variable-spelled tools/ path escapes the gate and a green suite again fails to prove every real release gate executes."
    },
    "SRC-063:R003": {
      "actionable": true,
      "class": "requirement",
      "text": "W2-001 P1: wintage.user.js::setupRouteGuard / interceptAttachShadow / CSSStyleSheet instrumentation - a fresh userscript generation retains stale global owners, so a clean reinstall stays bound to the first surviving generation."
