      "text": "W2-002 P1: tools/build-desktop.js::emit / top-level generation transaction - a builder that throws late publishes a permanently mixed desktop/out generation, because atomicity is per file rather than per generation and the lock is released by an unconditional finally."
    },
    "SRC-063:R005": {
      "actionable": true,
      "class": "requirement",
      "text": "W2-003 P2: release.ps1::pre-commit rollback - the rollback restores the tracked Git store to version N but leaves the .gitignore'd generated desktop/out tree at the failed run's N+1 payload, a cross-store split."
    },
    "SRC-063:R006": {
      "actionable": true,
      "class": "requirement",
      "text": "W2-004 P2: desktop/modules/common.ps1::Test-ManifestSchema / Set-ManifestEntry* / Get-ReapplyIntentToken - an older Vintage accepts a known target entry carrying fields introduced by a newer version, then rewrites it dropping the fields it does not understand."
